// Narrate: returns the AI-drafted narrative string, or null on any failure
// (including template-fallback absence and timeouts). Includes GPS, device, and metadata.
// Deterministic, fully on-device narrative built straight from the engine
// findings — used whenever the AI narrate endpoint is unreachable or returns
// nothing (a dropped connection, the model down, an empty reply). This is the
// deterministic "_deterministic_generate" fallback: it reads like a real
// forensic account — grouped by theme, in flowing prose, explaining what each
// cluster means and how serious it is — NOT a raw dump of numbered findings.
// It guarantees the report ALWAYS has a readable narrative, never leaves the
